0..80 Comment "// A circuit rule in a `theory` block: a rule whose inputs are a rewrite and two"
81..163 Comment "// data wires, and whose body wires two nodes. `Theory` codes no circuit rule yet,"
164..241 Comment "// so the rule is kept beside the block\'s value rather than in it. The wiring"
242..310 Comment "// follows Lafont\'s interaction nets (_Interaction Nets_, POPL 1990,"
311..339 Comment "// doi:10.1145/96709.96718)."
341..413 Comment "/// A data family whose constructors are written with the circuit arrow."
